{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarTop"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarTop\/init(title:hasLargeTitle:subtitle:leadingItems:principalItem:trailingItems:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarTop\/body(content:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarTop\/ViewModifier-Implementations"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSToolBarTop"}],"platforms":[{"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false}],"symbolKind":"struct","role":"symbol","title":"OUDSToolBarTop","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents14OUDSToolBarTopV","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSToolBarTop"}]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The top toolbar (aka "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"navigation bar"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" on iOS and iPadOS 18 and lower) sits at the top of the screen and provides contextual information"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and controls related to the current view."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It typically displays the page title, and may include navigation actions such as “Back” or “Close” as well as supplementary actions."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It can contain leading, principal (center, single item only), and trailing actions."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSToolBarTop"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Warning"}]},{"type":"text","text":": If an item is placed in principal position, the subtitle is never displayed (whatever "},{"code":"hasLargeTitle","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is), because"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI’s "},{"code":".principal","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" placement only replaces the inline compact bar title, not "},{"code":".navigationSubtitle()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (iOS 26+), which would"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"otherwise keep rendering next to the item with no visible title next to it. The title itself is displayed only if "},{"code":"hasLargeTitle","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (in that case it appears below the bar, in large title mode, not inside it)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Appearances","anchor":"Appearances","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With Liquid Glass \/ iOS 26+ the OS will change the rendering of the toolbar items depending to the context:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The OS can group the items of same types in one group with kind of rectangle (e.g. views with menus)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"But for buttons items they will remain isolated","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The placement of the title can be leading or centered depending to the length of the text","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The text can be truncated if there is not enough remaining space","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The OS can apply another style for the back button","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Without Liquid Glass \/ iOS 18 and lower, the OS won’t change that much the style of the toolbar items, Items won’t be visually grouped."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Globaly the appearence of the * navigation bar* elements is changed by the "},{"code":"oudsNavigationBarAppearance","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"helper of "},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" that must be applyed on the root view of the "},{"code":"NavigationStack","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for example."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Technical constraints","anchor":"Technical-constraints","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To be sure for iOS 18 and lower the back buttton and text have the good color, in your main view apply the following accent color:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["    struct AppMainView: View {","        var body: some View {","            ContentView()","                .accentColor(theme.colors.contentDefault)","        }","    }"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Platform considerations","anchor":"Platform-considerations","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The component is available on iOS, iPadOS, and visionOS","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The component is not available for watchOS, tvOS and macOS","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Badges uses","anchor":"Badges-uses","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For iOS 26 with Liquid Glass, the system badge is used because the OUDS badge component does not provide a suitable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rendering with the glassified effect applied on the top toolbar."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For iOS until 18 and without Liquid Glass  OUDS badge component is always used."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Code sample","anchor":"Code-sample","type":"heading","level":2},{"code":["    ContentView()","        .toolBarTop(\"Title\",","            leadingItems: {","                OUDSToolBarItem(navigation: .back())","            },","            principalItem: OUDSToolBarItem(icon: Image(decorative: \"search\"), accessibilityLabel: \"Search\") { \/* Action to process *\/ },","            trailingItems: {","                OUDSToolBarItem(label: \"Label\") { \/* Action to process *\/ }","                OUDSToolBarItem(icon: Image(decorative: \"some_image\"), accessibilityLabel: \"Label\") { \/* Action to process *\/ }","            }","        )"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" helper can also be used to apply a SwiftUI toolbar configuration."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["    toolBarTop(_:hasLargeTitle:subtitle:leadingItems:principalItem:trailingItems:)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Design documentation","a